WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:08.840
Barium is one of the, is the heaviest stable
alkaline earth, that is Group 2, the same

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:14.820
one as magnesium and beryllium and so, I believe,
though it wasn't labelled when I picked it

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:20.610
up in the ground, that this is an example
of barium sulphate. It is a very heavy mineral

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:32.950
and barium absorbs x-rays quite strongly,
so when people are ill and the doctors need

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:39.829
to x-ray their insides, you can’t look at
the inside of somebody’s stomach or throat

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:47.289
easily by x-rays but if you give them a drink
of barium which is called a Barium Meal or

00:00:47.289 --> 00:00:55.059
a Barium Enema depending on which hole you
put it in, then the tube or the gut becomes

00:00:55.059 --> 00:01:01.159
opaque to the x-rays and so then you can image
them quite easily and if there is some nasty

00:01:01.159 --> 00:01:04.249
hole or something then it appears much more
easily.

